# November 19, 2026: Chenango County, New York (Norwich, Oxford, Sherburne, Earlville, Smyrna, Guilford, Greene,
# Bainbridge, McDonough, Otselic). Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region scho), which offered Norwich,
# Morris and Oxford; the Atlas had nothing within 30 km of Norwich. Remains of the Chenango Canal (1837-1878) and the
# best standing buildings of the county seat and the hill hamlets. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text
# (tools/wiki_raw.py, including the Chenango County Register list), HMdb marker pages (read with tools/page.py), the
# Chenango County visitor guide's museum and canal pages (chenangocounty.org), the Chenango Land Trust home page, the
# Oxford Memorial Library and Village of Oxford library pages, the Town of Guilford's Rockwells Mills page, the
# Earlville Opera House home page, The Evening Sun (evesun.com), the Norwich Pharmacal Company Warehouse Register form
# (NPGallery) and Uncovering New York's Rexford Falls page.
from data_b import N
from data_ma import W
